msgctxt "ilifrv"
msgid "If you subscribed on our website, <link>cancel</link> within 14 days for a full refund. After a yearly renewal, canceling refunds the months that haven't started. Purchases in the App Store or Google Play follow Apple's or Google's refund rules."
